
Due to restrictions of Aminet I am unable to include the following required
files.  You must make sure these files are in the correct directories on
your system otherwise Trinity BBS may not function properly:

In your libs: directory:
   diskfont.library
   mathieeeedoubbas.library
   rexxarplib.library  
   rexxmath1.3.library 
   rexxmathsbii.library
   rexxsyslib.library
   rexxmathlib.library
   rexxsupport.library
   translator.library
   arp.library
  
In your C: directory
   move
   assign 
   copy
   rename
   mount
   rexxmast      <AREXX Binary
   hi               Files     >
   
Call Trinity BBS Headquarters if you need help finding any of these files.
